{"seq":1,"slug":"pg-statistic-mcv-histogram","title":"表统计信息构成：MCV、直方图与相关性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/statistics-cost-model/pg-statistic-mcv-histogram","wordCount":2555,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"表统计信息构成-mcv-直方图与相关性\">表统计信息构成：MCV、直方图与相关性</h1><p><code>ANALYZE</code> 在 <code>pg_statistic</code> 里为每一列留下的不是「一个选择率数字」，而是一组<strong>结构化的摘要</strong>：高频值列表、值域边界、NULL 比例、去重基数、平均宽度、物理相关性。规划器在估行时把 WHERE 条件拆成一个个子句，逐个去问这些摘要「这一列命中的比例大概是多少」，再把同一个表的多个选择率相乘。理解这套摘要的<strong>形状</strong>（而不是记几个数字），才能解释为什么同一个查询有时估 12 行、有时估 12000 行。本章属于「统计信息与代价模型」章节，向上承接 <code>../1_parse-rewrite-plan-pipeline/INDEX.md</code> 中查询经过重写后进入规划器的位置，向下为 <code>../3_plan-search-join/INDEX.md</code> 里的计划搜索提供输入。以下事实以 PostgreSQL 全球开发组发布的官方文档为准（PostgreSQL 18 于 2025-09-25 发布；PG 17 于 2024-09-26、PG 16 于 2023-09-14）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-七列摘要与三类估计\">核心概念：七列摘要与三类估计</h2><p><code>pg_statistic</code> 的每行描述一列，但真正被规划器读取的是经过 <code>pg_stats</code> 视图转换后的可读形式（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/view-pg-stats.html</code>）。关键字段分三类：<strong>描述分布形状的</strong>（<code>most_common_vals</code>/<code>most_common_freqs</code>、<code>histogram_bounds</code>）、<strong>描述整体规模的</strong>（<code>null_frac</code>、<code>n_distinct</code>、<code>avg_width</code>）、<strong>描述物理布局的</strong>（<code>correlation</code>）。<code>pg_statistic</code> 原始表只对超级用户可读，<code>pg_stats</code> 视图向普通用户暴露同样内容。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[ANALYZE 采样&lt;br/&gt;300 x statistics_target 行] --&gt; B[逐列聚合]&#10;    B --&gt; C[统计出现次数]&#10;    C --&gt; D{频率足够高的值?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[MCV 列表&lt;br/&gt;most_common_vals / freqs]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[进入剩余分布]&#10;    F --&gt; G[按值排序后切成等频区间]&#10;    G --&gt; H[直方图边界&lt;br/&gt;histogram_bounds 共 target+1 个]&#10;    C --&gt; I[n_distinct&lt;br/&gt;负值表示行数占比]&#10;    C --&gt; J[null_frac / avg_width]&#10;    B --&gt; K[按物理位置序统计]&#10;    K --&gt; L[correlation 相关系数]&#10;    E --&gt; M[规划器估行器]&#10;    H --&gt; M&#10;    I --&gt; M&#10;    J --&gt; M&#10;    L --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; N[EXPLAIN 的 rows= 与代价]\">flowchart TD\n    A[ANALYZE 采样&lt;br/&gt;300 x statistics_target 行] --&gt; B[逐列聚合]\n    B --&gt; C[统计出现次数]\n    C --&gt; D{频率足够高的值?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[MCV 列表&lt;br/&gt;most_common_vals / freqs]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[进入剩余分布]\n    F --&gt; G[按值排序后切成等频区间]\n    G --&gt; H[直方图边界&lt;br/&gt;histogram_bounds 共 target+1 个]\n    C --&gt; I[n_distinct&lt;br/&gt;负值表示行数占比]\n    C --&gt; J[null_frac / avg_width]\n    B --&gt; K[按物理位置序统计]\n    K --&gt; L[correlation 相关系数]\n    E --&gt; M[规划器估行器]\n    H --&gt; M\n    I --&gt; M\n    J --&gt; M\n    L --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; N[EXPLAIN 的 rows= 与代价]</pre><p>采样规模是这套设计的第一道取舍：<code>ANALYZE</code> 收集的行数为 <code>300 × statistics_target</code>，默认 <code>default_statistics_target = 100</code>，即 30000 行（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/runtime-config-query.html</code>）。<code>statistics_target</code> 可按列覆盖，取值 0–10000；设为 0 表示该列不收集分布摘要（只保留行数与宽度），这在小表或纯 I/O 列上是有意为之的省算力手段。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>默认容量</th>\n<th>服务的选择率场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>most_common_vals</code> / <code>most_common_freqs</code></td>\n<td>高频值及其频率</td>\n<td>至多 target 个</td>\n<td>等值（<code>=</code>、<code>IN</code>）命中已知值时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>histogram_bounds</code></td>\n<td>等频分位边界</td>\n<td>target + 1 个边界</td>\n<td>范围（<code>&lt;</code>、<code>BETWEEN</code>）落在非 MCV 区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>n_distinct</code></td>\n<td>去重基数</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>等值命中非 MCV 值时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>null_frac</code></td>\n<td>NULL 占比</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><code>IS NULL</code> 与剩余比例计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>avg_width</code></td>\n<td>平均字节宽度</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>估算元组宽度与哈希表大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>correlation</code></td>\n<td>物理序与逻辑序相关度</td>\n<td>取值 [-1, 1]</td>\n<td>索引扫描的 I/O 代价折扣</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>规划器的估行遵循一条主线：<strong>先用 MCV 处理「高频可列举」的部分，剩下的低概率质量交给基数和直方图</strong>。这就是为什么 MCV 列表的长度直接决定估计精度——列表一旦被截断，被挤出去的高频值会被当成均匀分布处理，估计立刻失真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mcv-列表-等值选择率的第一来源\">MCV 列表：等值选择率的第一来源</h2><p>当查询写 <code>WHERE country = &#39;SG&#39;</code>，规划器的第一反应不是「总行数除以去重基数」，而是查 <code>most_common_vals</code> 里有没有 <code>&#39;SG&#39;</code>。命中则直接返回对应 <code>most_common_freqs</code> 的比例，这是所有估计里最可靠的一类，因为它来自实测频率而非均匀假设。未命中（该值不在 MCV 中）则退化为经典公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>非MCV</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>MCV</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>MCV</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{eq,\\text{非MCV}} = \\frac{1 - f_{null} - \\sum_{v \\in \\text{MCV}} f_v}{n_{distinct} - |\\text{MCV}|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">非</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">MCV</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4031em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4671em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MCV</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7171em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MCV</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分子是「扣掉 NULL、再扣掉所有已列举高频值之后剩下的总概率质量」，分母是「这些质量平均分给多少个不同的值」。这个式子在两种情况下最不可靠：<code>n_distinct</code> 是估算值（<code>n_distinct</code> 为负时表示 <code>|n_distinct| × 行数</code>，即只统计了比例），以及 MCV 列表因为目标值太小而被截断。跨境电商订单表里 <code>payment_status</code> 这类列只有 5 个取值，默认 target=100 足以完整收纳，MCV 列表就是<strong>全量分布</strong>，此时估计误差接近零；而 <code>order_sn</code> 这类近乎唯一的列，即使拉高 target，MCV 也只会收录极少数重复值，等值估计几乎必然退回到基数公式。</p>\n<p>一个实践上可验证的判据：<code>pg_stats.most_common_freqs</code> 求和接近 <code>1 - null_frac</code>，说明该列的高频质量已被 MCV 完整覆盖，等值与 <code>IN</code> 估计可信；若求和明显偏小（例如 0.4），说明存在大量被截断的中频值，此时应针对该列执行 <code>ALTER TABLE ... ALTER COLUMN ... SET STATISTICS 1000</code> 并重新 <code>ANALYZE</code>（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-altertable.html</code>）。<code>IN</code> 列表的估计逐值查 MCV 相加，命中的值越多越准，未命中的值按剩余公式补齐。</p>\n<p>MCV 列表写入目录前还会经过一次裁剪：<code>analyze_mcv_list</code> 会丢弃频率低到不影响规划的值并重新归一化。这意味着「把 statistics_target 拉满」并不总能让 MCV 列表变长——样本被大量唯一值稀释时，分析阶段本身就会判定这些值不值得保留。定位时比较 <code>n_distinct</code> 与 <code>|MCV|</code> 的比值比盯 target 更直接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"直方图-范围选择率与线性插值\">直方图：范围选择率与线性插值</h2><p><code>histogram_bounds</code> 存的不是每个桶的计数，而是<strong>等频分位点</strong>：默认 target=100 时共 101 个边界，把非 MCV 的值域切成 100 个概率相等的区间（官方在行估计示例中称其为「等频直方图」，equal-frequency histogram，<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/planner-statistics.html</code>）。对 <code>WHERE amount BETWEEN 100 AND 500</code>，规划器定位 <code>100</code> 和 <code>500</code> 分别落在哪两个边界之间，然后按桶计数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mtext>端点桶内插值</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{range}(a \\le x \\le b) \\approx \\frac{i_b - i_a}{N_{bins}} + \\text{端点桶内插值}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1725em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3365em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bin</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">端点桶内插值</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>端点落在桶内部时用线性插值逼近：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>桶内</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>left</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>right</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>left</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{桶内}} = \\frac{1}{N_{bins}} \\cdot \\frac{b - \\text{left}(b)}{\\text{right}(b) - \\text{left}(b)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">桶内</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1574em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bin</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">right</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">left</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">left</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>。这套近似有两个已知偏差：一是<strong>桶内假设均匀分布</strong>，若桶内实际存在尖峰（例如促销日订单金额集中在一个点），插值会低估该点的命中；二是当查询值超出 <code>[min, max]</code> 边界时退化为 0 或 1，所以范围估计的可靠性取决于该列是否被真正采样到极值。等频而非等宽的选型正是为了对抗偏斜——等宽直方图在长尾分布上会把大量概率质量压进一个桶，等频则保证每个桶携带相同的概率。</p>\n<p>需要区分三次不同的「精度损失」：采样只读了 30000 行（抽样误差）、桶数只有 100（分桶误差）、桶内做了均匀假设（模型误差）。提高 <code>statistics_target</code> 同时缓解前两者，但第三者是直方图这一数据结构的内生限制——它也是 <code>CREATE STATISTICS</code> 多列 MCV 在 PG 12 被引入的动因之一（<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-createstatistics.html</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关性-为什么顺序决定索引代价\">相关性：为什么顺序决定索引代价</h2><p><code>pg_stats.correlation</code> 衡量列值与<strong>物理行序</strong>的统计相关度，取值 [-1, 1]；1 表示逻辑序与物理序完全一致，0 表示无关，负值表示反向一致。它在 <code>cost_index</code> 里直接参与 I/O 代价的混合计算。规划器先算出两个极端：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>max_IO</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>pages_fetched</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>cache_hit</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>min_IO</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.9</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>pages_fetched</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{max\\_IO} = \\text{pages\\_fetched} \\cdot (1 - \\text{cache\\_hit}), \\qquad \\text{min\\_IO} \\approx 1 + 0.9 \\cdot (\\text{pages\\_fetched} - 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max_IO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pages_fetched</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cache_hit</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min_IO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pages_fetched</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>max_IO</code> 假设每次访问都换一个新页（随机 I/O），<code>min_IO</code> 则计入连续页访问的缓存收益。最终用相关系数的平方在两个极端之间插值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Run_Cost</mtext><mo>+</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>max_IO</mtext><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>min_IO</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>max_IO</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>indexCorrelation</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Run\\_Cost} \\mathrel{+}= \\text{max\\_IO} + c^2 \\cdot (\\text{min\\_IO} - \\text{max\\_IO}), \\quad c = \\text{indexCorrelation}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Run_Cost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max_IO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min_IO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max_IO</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">indexCorrelation</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>平方项是关键：<code>c = 1</code>（列物理有序，例如自增主键或按时间写入的日志）时索引扫描的 I/O 代价降到连续读的水准；<code>c ≈ 0</code>（典型是 UUID 主键或随机写入的订单号）时退回到全随机读，索引扫描代价被显著抬高。这解释了一个常见现象：同一张表加索引后，<code>order_sn</code>（随机 UUID）上的范围查询仍可能被判去做位图索引扫描或全表扫描，而 <code>created_at</code>（时序追加）上的同类查询几乎必然走索引。</p>\n<p>一个易被忽略的细节：<code>correlation</code> 是<strong>单列</strong>统计量，只反映该列与堆表物理序的关系。索引扫描代价真正需要的是「索引序」与「物理序」的相关度，规划器用该列的物理相关性做代理——当索引是多列复合或表达式索引时，这个代理会失真。例如 <code>(shop_id, created_at)</code> 复合索引上的查询若只按 <code>created_at</code> 过滤，代理值可能与复合索引的实际有序程度不符。定位手段是 <code>EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS)</code> 对比实际读页数与规划器估算——若实际读页远低于估算，说明 correlation 被低估，索引其实更划算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扩展统计-多列相关性的补丁\">扩展统计：多列相关性的补丁</h2><p>单列摘要的盲区是<strong>列间相关</strong>。<code>WHERE country = &#39;SG&#39; AND city = &#39;Singapore&#39;</code>：规划器把两个单列选择率相乘，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{country} \\times S_{city}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；但如果 <code>country</code> 与 <code>city</code> 函数依赖（SG 的行几乎都在 Singapore），两个条件并不独立，乘法估计会严重偏小。PG 10 引入 <code>CREATE STATISTICS</code> 的 <code>dependencies</code> 与 <code>ndistinct</code>，PG 12 补齐 <code>mcv</code>（多列高频值组合）(<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-createstatistics.html</code>)。</p>\n<p><code>dependencies</code> 让规划器知道「city 由 country 决定」，在多条件相乘时对从属列做折扣；<code>ndistinct</code> 修正多列组合的去重基数（用于 <code>GROUP BY a, b</code> 与连接基数估计）；<code>mcv</code> 把「值组合」当作整体统计高频对。选择原则：等值组合过滤用 <code>mcv</code>，函数依赖导致的行数虚高用 <code>dependencies</code>，分组/连接基数用 <code>ndistinct</code>。代价是 <code>ANALYZE</code> 需额外维护这些摘要，因此只应对真正影响关键查询的列组合创建。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE STATISTICS s_order_geo (dependencies, mcv, ndistinct)&#10;    ON country, city FROM orders;&#10;ANALYZE orders;&#10;SELECT * FROM pg_statistic_ext WHERE stxname = &#39;s_order_geo&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> STATISTICS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s_order_geo (dependencies, mcv, ndistinct)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> country, city </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ANALYZE orders;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pg_statistic_ext </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stxname </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's_order_geo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个可验证的对照实验：分别在建立与不建立扩展统计的情况下，对强相关列组合执行 <code>EXPLAIN</code> 并比较 <code>rows=</code> 估算与实际 <code>actual rows</code>。扩展统计的价值只能通过这种对照观测，<code>pg_statistic_ext</code> 本身只存定义与序列化后的摘要，不直接给出「修正了多少」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>ANALYZE</code> 产出的是一组结构化摘要，不是单一数字；<code>pg_stats</code> 是它的可读视图，<code>most_common_freqs</code> 求和接近 <code>1 - null_frac</code> 说明高频质量已被完整覆盖。</li>\n<li>MCV 列表承担等值估计的第一优先级；未命中时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1 - f_{null} - \\sum f_{MCV}) / (n_{distinct} - |MCV|)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<code>n_distinct</code> 为负表示它只是一个比例。</li>\n<li>直方图是等频分位点（默认 101 个边界），范围估计靠分桶计数加线性插值；三次精度损失中「桶内均匀假设」无法靠提高 target 消除。</li>\n<li><code>correlation</code> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 插值决定索引扫描的 I/O 代价，单列自增/时序列接近 1，UUID 随机列接近 0；它是「单列 vs 物理序」的代理，对复合索引会失真。</li>\n<li>列间相关由 <code>CREATE STATISTICS</code> 的 <code>dependencies</code> / <code>ndistinct</code> / <code>mcv</code> 修补，只对关键列组合创建；效果必须用 <code>EXPLAIN</code> 的估算 vs 实际对照验证，而非凭定义断言。</li>\n<li>调优入口是同一个旋钮：<code>ALTER TABLE ... ALTER COLUMN ... SET STATISTICS</code>（0–10000，默认继承 <code>default_statistics_target = 100</code>），改后必须重新 <code>ANALYZE</code> 才生效。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"表统计信息构成：MCV、直方图与相关性","id":"表统计信息构成-mcv-直方图与相关性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：七列摘要与三类估计","id":"核心概念-七列摘要与三类估计"},{"level":2,"text":"MCV 列表：等值选择率的第一来源","id":"mcv-列表-等值选择率的第一来源"},{"level":2,"text":"直方图：范围选择率与线性插值","id":"直方图-范围选择率与线性插值"},{"level":2,"text":"相关性：为什么顺序决定索引代价","id":"相关性-为什么顺序决定索引代价"},{"level":2,"text":"扩展统计：多列相关性的补丁","id":"扩展统计-多列相关性的补丁"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"规划入口、计划缓存与预编译语句复用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/parse-rewrite-plan-pipeline/planner-entry-plan-cache"},"next":{"title":"选择率估算与代价模型代价参数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/statistics-cost-model/selectivity-cost-model"}}